  ['<code>POST /api/ai-configs</code>', 'Creates one. The core stamps <code>owner_user_id</code> from the verified identity, so a body cannot name another tenant, and fills what is left out (<code>openai</code>, <code>gpt-4o-mini</code>, user template <code>&#123;text&#125;</code>, temperature <code>0.7</code>, enabled, <code>en</code>).'],
